# interfaces/pthread_create
interfaces/pthread_create/1-3                            # timeout
interfaces/pthread_create/1-6                            # unresolved
interfaces/pthread_create/14-1                           flaky  # wedge when PM panics ("tell_vfs: not idle: 2308") in its SIGUSR1 storm; the storm without SCHED_FIFO does it too, before this change

